  "problem": "Given that $r(t)=⟨{t}^{2}-21,\\,\\sqrt{3t-9}⟩,$ calculate $r(6).$\n\n$r(6)=⟨$\n{{field-1}} $,$\n\n{{field-2}}$⟩$",
